# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated kickstart files — CONTAIN CLEARTEXT SECRETS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# autodeploy.ps1 extracts these into its working directory, edits them, and
# leaves them behind whenever CleanupCFGFiles=false — which CFGOnly=true forces.
# They carry veeamadmin.password, veeamso.password, both mfaSecretKey values and
# veeamso.recoveryToken in cleartext. Never commit them.
# Anchored to the repo root: conf/ and other tracked .cfg content is unaffected.
/vbr-ks.cfg
/proxy-ks.cfg
/grub.cfg

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Run transcripts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root-anchored on purpose: log/ holds two sample logs that are committed
# deliberately as documentation.
/ISO_Customization_*.log
/HyperV-QA_*.log
/VeeamDeploy_*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ISO images — sources, working copies (_customized) and backups (_backup_*)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.iso

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# User-supplied inputs
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Veeam licence files: LicenseVBRTune reads license/ from the working directory.
/license/
*.lic

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor / OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
